   {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "p",
    "html": "<span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\">When launching the class of the legendary Alicia Keys in November 2020, we wanted to remind people that their voices have the power to shape our world – through every word they think, say, write or sing. In collaboration with award-winning director Jenn Nkiru, we worked with Todd Tourso, creative director for Beyoncé and Lady Gaga, to bring Alicia’s message of empowerment and connection to life during a time when it was needed more than ever. Remember: Your voice is the most powerful thing you have to offer.</span></span>",
    "text": "When launching the class of the legendary Alicia Keys in November 2020, we wanted to remind people that their voices have the power to shape our world – through every word they think, say, write or sing. In collaboration with award-winning director Jenn Nkiru, we worked with Todd Tourso, creative director for Beyoncé and Lady Gaga, to bring Alicia’s message of empowerment and connection to life during a time when it was needed more than ever. Remember: Your voice is the most powerful thing you have to offer.",
